<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Ngai Hing Hong suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Ngai Hing Hong suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of plastic colourants manufacturer Ngai Hing Hong Co Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Ngai Hing Hong shares fell HK$0.425 or 16.83 percent to end at HK$2.10 per share on Monday. Volume was 2.23 million shares worth HK$4.85 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
